#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Tch, sure.  Plenty.  But we never got our hands on any of it.  Not a single "
"thing worth taking comes as easily as you like, and you'd do well to remember"
" that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "What was the coolest thing you ever found?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Noted."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Drive Core, Cruiser class, mostly intact.  We picked it up on scanners in the"
" stern section of a Titan II class.  It was partially buried at the bottom of"
" a ravine, old gal must a split in the atmo.  Only ever managed a glimpse of "
"the damn thing though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Net Breacher woke up the Ship's AI.  The bastard fried her brain from the inside out.  Rail from a Wraith turned another two to paste while everyone was still losing their shit.  Rest is a haze of bloody screams and a hail of bullets and plasma.  Few that got out died later of blood loss or froze from suits full o' holes.\n"
"Veronica removes her glove revealing a metallic hand that glints brightly in the dim light of the structure.\n"
"Woulda been dead myself but the plasma burst that took my arm cauterized the wound.  Patched the suit up with foamcrete on my way out.  The Doc had a lot of fun with that one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Veronica slowly slides her glove back over her hand and meets your eyes with a scornful gaze.\n"
"Those kids were hopeful idiots but they knew what they were doing.  This place 'ill take everything from you no matter how prepared you think you are.  Leave as soon as you can.  And stay the hell away from the graveyards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "What happened afterwards, how did you end up here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"I pulled myself together and set up this little abode.  Been selling tools "
"and gear to the folk that come through 'ere for a time now.  Buncha upstarts "
"followed suit and set up their own little places.  And now we got our own "
"neighborhood.  If it weren't for the nosey UICA pricks and especially that "
"little shit Atermis I'd almost call it livable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "Why stay?  You must have enough to leave the planet by now?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid ""
"Well, it ain't like I got someplace to be.  And, well, I can't rightly "
"explain it, but, I feel like I still got business here.  There's a score that"
" needs to be settled, and it just wouldn't sit right leaving things at that."
"  Salus ain't through with me yet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
msgid "I understand"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&The workshop is a chaotic mess of spare parts, tools, and partially assembled components littering every surface.  <npc_name> is muttering to himself under his breath when you approach.\n"
"Oh hello, do you need something?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&The workshop is a chaotic mess of spare parts, tools, and partially assembled components littering every surface.  <npc_name> is muttering to himself under his breath when you approach.\n"
"Do you need something salvor?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "What do you have in stock?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "You said something about a special offer?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "Do you sell any vehicles here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "Is that Lynx still for sale?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "So, why did you come to Salus IV?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&Wait.  Hold on a second, please don't take this the wrong way, but you "
"wouldn't happen to be from Earth by any chance?."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "How can you tell?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "Sorry, you're mistaken."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&I knew it!  I'm from Earth too so I could just tell.  The way you carry "
"yourself, it's not like the rest of the salvors around here.  But you get it "
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&Right?  Right!  Of course you do.  You understand!  This place is about as "
"far a cry from civilization as you can get.  And the people, god, the people!"
"  This post sees a never-ending deluge of criminals and brawn for brains.  "
"And it's like none of them have even heard of a shower!  Just the other day, "
"a man emerged from the icy waste covered in blood and viscera.  And everyone "
"just ignored him acting like that was a completely normal thing to do!  I am "
"going to get off this god-forsaken rock if it's the last thing I do, I swear "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&No, don't give me that!  I can tell, just by looking at you, I know.  Don't "
"worry, I'm from Earth too!  I get it: some people around here get all weird "
"when they find out where you're from.  But you won't get that from me. Us "
"Earthers got to stick together, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "&Sure, whatever you say, pal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&Right!  Sorry, this is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Mostly I just "
"fix up the patrol vehicles.  But I am also in charge of maintaining our stock"
" of vehicle parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with salvors in "
"order to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or "
"chits in exchange.  I'll give you a nice price, just: Don't tell my boss.  "
"And one more thing, I've got something really special for sale, if you're "
"interested."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "Can you show me your stock?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "What's this special offer?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "Thanks, I don't need anything right now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"This is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Please don't touch anything "
"unless you're buying.  I fix up the patrol vehicles and maintain our stock of"
" spare parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with outsiders in order"
" to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or chits in "
"exchange."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"Here's the thing: A while back one of our patrol vehicles got totalled when "
"some junior officers took it for a joy ride.  We are in queue to get a "
"replacement issued to us and High Command just wants the old one broken down "
"for parts.  Well the chief and I agree that's a little wasteful.  So I "
"patched the damn thing back together with the parts we had on hand.  And now "
"we're looking for a way to make it, disappear.  You follow?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "How much do want for it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "I'll cut you a deal.  Let's say 30,000 USD and it's all yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "I'll take it"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"&As I've SAID before: I'm only authorized to trade vehicle parts and scraps."
"  Our patrol vehicles are not up for auction.  Now if you don't mind, I have "
"work to do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"Surely you can arrange for a patrol car to be 'lost'.  I can make it worth "
"your while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/ground_quartermaster.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/ground_quartermaster.json
msgid "Nevermind then."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"I'd report you if this sort of behavior wasn't already so laughably "
"perdictable.  Just go away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"Alright, alright.  Just not so loud.  Here's the thing: A while back one of "
"our patrol vehicles got totalled when some junior officers took it for a joy "
"ride.  We are in queue to get a replacement issued to us and High Command "
"just wants the old one broken down for parts.  Well the chief and I agree "
"that's a little wasteful.  So I patched the damn thing back together with the"
" parts we had on hand.  And now we're looking for a way to make it, "
"disappear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> sighs.\n"
"Yes it is, are you interested?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "How much do want for it again?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "40,000 USD and it's all yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"It wasn't my choice, obviously.  That fucking bastard back in Alpha Centauri "
"had me transferred to this frozen hell.  Pulled strings with the staff in "
"command.  I signed on to help put Earth back where it belongs: on top.  Not "
"freeze my arse off fixing barely held-together scrap in the middle of fucking"
" nowhere.  Mercurial doesn't even give a shit about this place.  I don't know"
" why the UICA even bothers to station us here.  If you ask me this planet "
"should have stayed abandoned."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "Who's the bastard?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "What makes you think Mercurial doesn't care?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "Sorry I asked."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"My former superior officer, the prick.  Always hovering my shoulder like a "
"damn drone.  I won't miss that uptight control freak.  We fought a lot and "
"didn't see things eye to eye.  But this?  I never imagined the fucker would "
"stoop this low.  Hell of a disciplinary action, I'll tell you that much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid ""
"The last thing they did was set up their little clinic on the station, and "
"they haven't done jack since.  No communications, no re-colonization efforts,"
" no survey teams.  They hardly even seem to care about going down planetside."
"  Not like I blame them.  The colony didn't work out before so, why bother?  "
"This place is clearly not worth the effort."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "I guess there are some rocks even Corpos won't touch."
msgstr ""

