#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The exiled scion of an unfavorable seat within the Wraitheon board of "
"directors, wealthy beyond measure even in their estrangement.  Sent to the "
"frontier in a last-ditch effort to salvage their reputation, or more likely, "
"to find a silent and politically convenient death."
